This repository has the code, original data, and processed data used in the manuscript by DeLong et al in Ecology
Publication data might be 2026 or 2027

Data on barn owl diets come from the OS-Prey database (Uiterwaal et al 2026)
Data on mammal body sizes come from EltonTraits (Wilman et al 2014)
Data on mammal density come from Santini et al 2022

The analysis script is "baow_optimal_foraging_analysis.jl".

Code was last run in Julia 1.13
